# Tests — `test/models`

## Role

- Document the persisted contract: associations, scopes, validations, domain instance methods.

## Strategy (recommended order)

1. Scopes: assert on stable result sets (minimal factory data).
2. Validations: prefer Shoulda matchers to reduce noise.
3. Instance methods: start with predicates/state rules; then derived calculations.
4. Side effects: assert observable outcomes (enqueued job, column) via services/controllers/jobs — not model callbacks.

## Factories

- Use factories; when new required columns land, update factories rather than bypassing validations.
